    "detailed_description": "Shipwrecked on the mysterious shores of an uncharted island, your determination for survival is put to the test. Embark on the journey alone or with allies as you unravel its secrets. Battle, build structures, refine your crafting, and triumph over lurking foes in this intriguing land.<br><br><strong>UNVEIL THE ISLAND'S SECRETS</strong><br>Explore the mysteries of the island's landscape, venturing into unexplored areas. Step into the shoes of a pirate and engage in strategic battles against your foes.<br><br><strong>CONSTRUCT, CRAFT, AND OUTLAST</strong><br>As you navigate the island's mysterious terrain, collect vital resources to craft weapons, tools, fortifications, and defenses, all while contending with hidden dangers.<br><br><strong>COOPERATIVE ENDEAVORS</strong><br>Face the trials of this uncharted island individually or in the company of allies. Share resources, synergize efforts, and collaboratively establish fortified bases to conquer the challenges that await.",
